  "_comment": "Spoken animal questions for SweetYaar Studio (bucket folder animal-prompts/). One block per language; 'defaults' applies to every language, and a language may override any of its keys. output_format: what ElevenLabs returns, the best our Starter plan allows (lossless 48 kHz PCM; 44.1 kHz PCM needs Pro); the script converts it to sample_rate WAV with ffmpeg. Model and voice settings match the website's (Eleven v4: our four voices are professional clones verified on v4; v3 made Danit sound wrong). trim_threshold_db/target_rms_db/peak_db: silence trim and loudness levelling. seed: fixed, so a rerun gives the same take. max_length_ratio/max_retakes: a take much longer than its language's median (the model sometimes repeats the start of the sentence) is redone with other seeds. Generate with generate.py (see README.md).",

